<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Comments on Shirakii</title><link>/tags/comments/</link><description>Recent content in Comments on Shirakii</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>Shirakii</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 24 Dec 2024 04:01:08 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="/tags/comments/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>在博客中集成 Bluesky 评论</title><link>/post/bluesky-comments/</link><pubDate>Mon, 23 Dec 2024 20:11:08 +0800</pubDate><guid>/post/bluesky-comments/</guid><description>&lt;img src="/post/bluesky-comments/cover.webp" alt="Featured image of post 在博客中集成 Bluesky 评论" />&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>有一天我看到了&lt;a class="link" href="https://passivestar.xyz/posts/hugo/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>passivestar&lt;/a>的博客，发现他把 &lt;code>Bluesky&lt;/code> 的评论集成到了博客内，但是看到&lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/czue/bluesky-comments" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>文末项目&lt;/a>的使用对我来说太过复杂和繁琐。&lt;br>因此我在&lt;a class="link" href="https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:q7w52744vwysd6iobeqo5tni/post/3lbsizqjik22o" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
>Lou&lt;/a>的启发下，想结合Hugo模板尽量方便地在网站内使用&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote>
